  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Online pre-incubation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this programme is to train early stage Senegalese start-ups and to enlarge the impact of the current Orange Corners programme in Dakar. Online pre-incubation allows to reach a large number of entrepreneurs and guide them in their early stage start-up journey. The entrepreneurs will improve their business idea and will be better prepared to explain their business plan.</narrative>
  </description>
